# Project Memory
- Treat `.devos/` as project-local memory when present.
- Read `.devos/project.md`, `.devos/architecture.md`, `.devos/decisions.md`, and `.devos/worklog.md` before major changes.
- Never store credentials, tokens, secrets, private keys, or sensitive personal data in project memory.
- Record durable architectural decisions with rationale and date.
- Update the worklog after significant implementation or verification milestones.
